 <p data-t="s5p2">Barefoot was in fact the category our designer was sceptical about at first. Although she has worn barefoot footwear herself since 2012, for a long time she could not find a model in which she felt safe and stable enough in the mountains. So she took the first NORTHFINDER samples to the Dolomites — along with competitors’ barefoot shoes and classic hiking boots “just in case” in her backpack.</p>
 <div class="a-strip">
